Source-only geometry comparisons, not Bedrock candidates. Original shell is evaluated TESTE34 from source_meshes, unchanged source orientation and all source vertices including unused ones. Band is original TESTE29 evaluated at render subdivision level 2, from V3 extraction. Both original materials have stone BaseColor [0.63,0.62,0.59] and roughness 0.8. Diagnostic gold/blue are not source material assignments. Body and halo in renders remain legacy reduced geometry, never highpoly substitutions. See source-export.json and shell_band_v3/evidence/source-objects.json for original object names and modifiers. Original source files are untouched.
